1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,395
Other animals use other systems.

2
00:00:02,395 --> 00:00:08,606
Grasshoppers are X X and X O: the male has a single X and no Y.

3
00:00:08,606 --> 00:00:15,651
In birds and butterflies it is reversed: the female is Z W and decides the sex.

4
00:00:15,651 --> 00:00:23,033
And in honey bees, fertilised eggs become females and unfertilised eggs become males.

